      "id": "claim_871b42086b524409a90edf88a8599a15",
      "statement": "Digital Platforms Engineering is the listed owning team for exactly three Developer Platform APIs: API-01 Accounts (v3.4, /accounts/v3), API-02 Transactions (v3.1, /transactions/v3) and API-17 Statements & Documents (v1.4, /documents/v1). API-01 and API-02 sit in Retail & Commercial Banking, and API-17 in Client Servicing.",
