    {
      "id": "claim_a46819f4a6504bb8b64887062d1c6d41",
      "statement": "The team's commitments differ per API: API-01 has 1,200 req/min per client (burst 200/s) and a 99.95% monthly availability and p95 180 ms SLO; API-02 has 1,000 req/min and 99.95% / p95 250 ms; API-17 has 300 req/min and 99.9% availability with no latency target. All three are classified Confidential - Client Data.",
