      "id": "claim_7daefc235e404bd4a1e64b651d4016e3",
      "statement": "The team's APIs depend on each other and on shared upstreams: API-01 and API-02 both draw on the core deposit system (DDA) and the card processing platform; API-01 also draws on Loan Servicing API-11, and API-02 on a merchant enrichment service; API-17 takes upstream data from API-01 plus a document archive, and API-01 lists API-17 as a downstream consumer.",
