    {
      "id": "claim_484a8e20f076414294b7c29b841275f7",
      "statement": "Platform-wide rules apply to the team's APIs: OAuth 2.0 with client credentials plus mutual TLS for servers and authorization code with PKCE for customer-facing use, 15-minute JWT tokens, cursor pagination, rate-limit headers with Retry-After on 429, a standard error object, and path-based major versions supported for at least 12 months after the successor reaches GA.",
